From 3fa401fc2d980438182fa44bf73543bd18796406 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:47:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands so backend actions
 bypass prompt sends

Selected chat messages whose first token is a slash command route through the provider command hook instead of the ordinary prompt path. Codex dispatches those commands through the app-server action surface, while providers without native commands return a visible unsupported-command message.
---
